<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on nickel.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on nickel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on nickel.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one tenth of one metric tonne of nickel</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$7,500.00   $94.50	  16.97 PCT     7.64 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$8,250.00   $68.50	  23.75 PCT    10.54 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JAN.97-28.JAN.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
